{"version":"https://jsonfeed.org/version/1.1","title":"Database Exfiltration - Tag | ꜱᴘᴀᴡɴ𝟐ᴘᴡɴ","description":"Personal CTF writeups and cybersecurity notes.","home_page_url":"https://ctf.spawn2pwn.my.id/","language":"en","icon":"https://ctf.spawn2pwn.my.id/apple-touch-icon.png","favicon":"https://ctf.spawn2pwn.my.id/favicon.ico","authors":[{"name":"spawn2pwn","url":"https://github.com/nfl-alvis","avatar":"https://ctf.spawn2pwn.my.id/images/IdaWin.png"}],"items":[{"title":"Inj3ction Time","date_published":"2026-02-22T00:00:00&#43;07:00","date_modified":"2026-11-04T17:00:28&#43;07:00","id":"https://ctf.spawn2pwn.my.id/posts/inj3ction-time/","url":"https://ctf.spawn2pwn.my.id/posts/inj3ction-time/","authors":[{"name":"spawn2pwn","url":"https://github.com/nfl-alvis","avatar":"https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/b01c9af4b33ead25b072a03f8d0c5508?s=32&amp;d=mp"}],"tags":["SQL Injection","UNION Based","Sqlmap","Database Exfiltration"],"summary":" I stumbled upon this website and I think they have the flag in there somewhere. UNION might be a helpful command.\nTL;DR Inj3ction Time is a web security challenge demonstrating UNION-based SQL Injection. The application queries a database record based on the id GET parameter without input validation. Using sqlmap or a manual UNION SELECT payload extracts the database contents and leaks the secret flag stored in the table. Initial Analysis The target application presents an input form asking for an ID:\n","content_html":"\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"/posts/inj3ction-time/images/web.webp\" title=\"/posts/inj3ction-time/images/web.webp\" data-thumbnail=\"/posts/inj3ction-time/images/web.webp\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003e/posts/inj3ction-time/images/web.webp\u003c/h2\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg loading=\"lazy\" src='/posts/inj3ction-time/images/web.webp' alt=\"/posts/inj3ction-time/images/web.webp\" height=\"1052\" width=\"1859\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003cblockquote\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eI stumbled upon this website and I think they have the flag in there somewhere. UNION might be a helpful command.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"details admonition abstract open\"\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"details-summary admonition-title\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"icon fa-solid fa-clipboard-list\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003eTL;DR\u003ci class=\"details-icon fa-solid fa-angle-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"details-content\"\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"admonition-content\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInj3ction Time\u003c/strong\u003e is a web security challenge demonstrating \u003cstrong\u003eUNION-based SQL Injection\u003c/strong\u003e. The application queries a database record based on the \u003ccode\u003eid\u003c/code\u003e GET parameter without input validation. Using \u003ccode\u003esqlmap\u003c/code\u003e or a manual \u003ccode\u003eUNION SELECT\u003c/code\u003e payload extracts the database contents and leaks the secret flag stored in the table.\u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"heading-element\" id=\"initial-analysis\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eInitial Analysis\u003c/span\u003e\n  \u003ca href=\"#initial-analysis\" class=\"heading-mark\"\u003e\n    \u003csvg class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\n  \u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe target application presents an input form asking for an ID:\u003c/p\u003e"}]}